# Production build only. Vite reads this for `vite build`, never for `vite dev`.
#
# The API is not same-origin with this app: it runs on Railway, the client on Vercel. `vercel.json`
# rewrites /api/* to it server-side so the browser still sees one origin — without which the CSRF
# double-submit cannot work at all, since JavaScript here could not read a cookie set by the API's
# host. This is the client half of that arrangement: it must match the rewrite's source prefix.
#
# Kept in the repository rather than in Vercel's dashboard so it cannot drift from the vercel.json
# it depends on. Nothing here is a secret — it is a path. A dashboard variable of the same name
# overrides this file if a deployment ever needs to point somewhere else.
VITE_API_BASE=/api
